error[L0404]: `string` does not implement `copy`
 --> check/repeat_first_strings.rslisp:5:18
  |
1 | (defn repeat-first! (names) (push! names (at names 0)))
  |                                          ------------ this copies the borrowed value
...
5 |   (repeat-first! (mut names))
  |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^ this needs `copy`
  |
  = note: `copy` is implemented for: bool, char, unit, i8, i16, i32, i64, i128, isize, u8, u16, u32, u64, u128, usize, f32, f64, (where (a) (ref a)), (where ((a copy)) (option a)), (where ((a copy) (b copy)) (result a b)), (where ((a copy) (b copy)) (pair a b))
  = help: to copy a value that is not `copy`, write `(clone ...)` around it
